<view class="page {{dark ? 'page-dark' : 'page-light'}}">
    <view class="hero">
        <text class="title">设置</text>
        <text class="subtitle">办事雷达 · TaskCard 小程序</text>
    </view>

    <view class="group">
        <text class="group-title">外观</text>
        <view class="opt-row">
            <view
                class="opt {{appearance === item.mode ? 'opt-active' : ''}}"
                wx:for="{{appearanceOptions}}"
                wx:key="mode"
                data-mode="{{item.mode}}"
                bindtap="setAppearance"
            >
                <text class="opt-label">{{item.label}}</text>
                <text class="opt-check" wx:if="{{appearance === item.mode}}">✓</text>
            </view>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="group">
        <text class="group-title">账号</text>
        <view class="row" wx:if="{{loggedIn}}">
            <text class="row-label">已登录</text>
            <text class="row-value">{{accountName}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row row-tap" bindtap="onLogin" wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}">
            <text class="row-label accent">登录 WorkBuddy 账号</text>
            <text class="row-arrow">›</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row row-tap" bindtap="onLogout" wx:if="{{loggedIn}}">
            <text class="row-label danger">退出登录</text>
            <text class="row-arrow">›</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="group">
        <text class="group-title">数据</text>
        <view class="row">
            <text class="row-label">已保存的卡</text>
            <text class="row-value">{{cardCount}} 张</text>
        </view>
        <view class="row row-tap" bindtap="clearAll">
            <text class="row-label danger">清空所有卡</text>
            <text class="row-arrow">›</text>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="group">
        <text class="group-title">关于</text>
        <view class="row">
            <text class="row-label">版本</text>
            <text class="row-value">1.0.0</text>
        </view>
        <view class="about">
            <text class="about-text">· 解析与截图识别均使用免费接口，无需密钥、不开云服务。</text>
            <text class="about-text">· 截图识别依赖微信自带 OCR，需在微信公众平台为小程序添加"微信OCR"插件（免费）。</text>
            <text class="about-text">· 登录 WorkBuddy 账号后，办事卡会同步到云端，可在网页版与手机端共享同一份数据。</text>
        </view>
    </view>
</view>
